*
# Allowlist build context for the API image (packages/api/Dockerfile).
# The context is the repo root, so only package manifests, the root lockfile and
# the API source may enter the image: no .env, js/config.js, .git or node_modules.
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/*/package.json
!packages/api/src
!packages/api/src/**
